ness_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"a0jSWZ8xRTffHVF1IldNqQ","review_id":"kJ7FwQHSg-3O93QXxl9I2Q","date":"2019-06-17T20:06:48","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9455074071884155,"text_excerpt":"I'm excited to know there's a Faubourg Bistro closer to home, probably not a good thing for me but I'll control myself. The location is huge! And ample space to go with a large group. Love how they pugs as their customer markers when you order food. The food is just as great as their French quarter location. My go to is always the chicken tenders and always the spot. But if you're always with a large group, I'd recommend splitting a Mac n cheese bites order. We had our order to go but I will definitely be coming back to check out the dine in experience!"},{"business_id":"a0jSWZ8xRTffHVF1IldNqQ","review_id":"AVe5mhrZxiv-F0OcKoRdFA","date":"2019-06-16T03:49:23","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9448449611663818,"text_excerpt":"Ahh! Finally! I feel like I've been waiting forever for this location to open, especially since David and I are such a fan of the French Quarter location. We stopped in tonight for a quick bite and this spot didn't disappoint. They don't have a full menu yet, but we got an order of the 5 cheese mac and cheese and it was WONDERFUL. We loved the atmosphere of the place, there is a full bar with music videos playing, and the bartender just couldn't have been nicer. They have a whole selection of burgers and I will definitely be back to get an order of their pizza mac and cheese, which is one of my faves. This is going to be a hot late night spot among the local college crowd and I'm so happy..."},{"business_id":"a0jSWZ8xRTffHVF1IldNqQ","review_id":"o8OtpyYYmPYnLwvgpaQT9A","date":"2019-09-02T16:38:24","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9384506940841675,"text_excerpt":"Faubourg opened right across the street from my house so it's a 2 second walk. The people that work there are very nice and prompt. The food was good! I got the burger and the Mac and cheese is a must. I don't know how one person could eat that much Mac. Good happy hour so keep your eye out for that."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"a0jSWZ8xRTffHVF1IldNqQ","photo_id":"dmuF_xzWzPHzjD-fv6or6w","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/dmuF_xzWzPHzjD-fv6or6w.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.905528724193573},{"business_id":"a0jSWZ8xRTffHVF1IldNqQ","photo_id":"-sLRC5Ago67Pew3QB4X5oA","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/-sLRC5Ago67Pew3QB4X5oA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8519852161407471},{"business_id":"a0jSWZ8xRTffHVF1IldNqQ","photo_id":"oeKFq1EKjTO2KJ2XfyLBUQ","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/oeKFq1EKjTO2KJ2XfyLBUQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8001682162284851}]},"notebook_case":null}
